  "hardLockStep2Accounts": "Android only allows hard lock when the phone has NO accounts. Go to Settings › Users & accounts (or \"Accounts\") and remove all of them: Google, manufacturer accounts (HeyTap/Oppo, Mi, Samsung…), and app accounts like Zalo, Telegram, WhatsApp if they are listed.",
